"item or the impossibility of a project in the supply, the interruption of "
"the delivery service or a foreign cause, the original financial adjustment "
"of the unimplemented application includes the restitution of previously "
"collected products or services that have not been provided, in accordance "
"with the terms and means prescribed by law; if a portion of the request is "
"executed, the amounts due shall be calculated for the refund of the "
"unimplemented portion after the receipt has been properly stated independent"
" fee has been shown."
