"is approved, this may require a new account of the transportation fee in "
"accordance with the branch ' s policy, the client ' s acceptance is required"
" prior to the receipt of the increase, and the refusal of the adjusted wage "
"does not result in automatic loss of the client ' s rights for payment or "
"expenses to be reimbursed by the law."
msgstr ""

#. module: ab_ecommerce_storefront
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ab_ecommerce_storefront.order_delivery_terms_page
msgid ""
"If the delivery of a particular item becomes unsafe due to temperature "
"requirements, pregnancy restrictions or transportation conditions, "
"pharmacies are entitled to suspend transmission or to propose a legitimate "
"alternative means, and a product whose safety has been compromised must not "
"be sent to meet an estimated date."
msgstr ""

#. module: ab_ecommerce_storefront
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ab_ecommerce_storefront.order_delivery_terms_page
msgid ""
