"requirements of a pharmaceutical, safety and professional compliance shall "
"be a priority. Pharmacies may suspend transmission, request receipt from the"
" branch or arrange an appropriate means, indicating options and adjusting "
"the value as required by law, without an unlawful undertaking of a remedial "
"outcome or an untimely date."
msgstr ""

#. module: ab_ecommerce_storefront
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ab_ecommerce_storefront.order_delivery_terms_page
msgid ""
