"delivery, it should not be used and pharmacies should be reported for "
"examination and treatment, and the client is not obliged to bear damage that"
" has been established before the transfer of possession to it in "
"circumstances where the supplier ' s obligation is established by law, nor "
"is his right to manifest defects simply to sign receipt or not to open the "
"packaging to the delegate."
