" the site summary, the payment of the client is not automatically discounted"
" without proper bond or consent and the fees approved by the branch at the "
"time of delivery or in the legally available manner may be collected, "
"provided that they are presented and agreed before the client is obligated "
"and documented in the appropriate accounting document."
