"Branch, the final settlement of applications that have not been completed is"
" presented in accordance with the correct data of the branch at the time of "
"confirmation, indicating the difference and approving the client, while the "
"price or fee that has become part of a binding contract is not modified "
"unilaterally in contravention of the law; and mandatory pricing rules remain"
" applicable in all cases."
